Validate uploaded files.

Treat uploaded media and user-provided prompts as untrusted input.

Performance

Do not process large videos synchronously in HTTP requests.

Video processing must use background jobs.

AI processing must use background jobs where appropriate.

Do not load entire large videos into application memory unnecessarily.

